# RSP
[RSP] - Random Super Powers - Plugin for Counter-Strike: Source.
Copyright © 2026 PaK. All rights reserved.
Randomly gives each player a unique super power a.k.a. ability at the beginning of each round.

Current active super power pool:
01. Aimbot - Firearm hits count as headshots for damage and killfeed.
02. Anomaly - Activate to teleport to your position from 7 seconds ago. Cooldown: 15 seconds.
03. Armoured - Reduces incoming damage by 65–85%.
04. Assassin - Firearm and knife hits deal double damage when you attack an enemy from behind.
05. Astronaut - Your gravity is reduced.
06. Avenger - You inherit the superpower of the first teammate who dies this round.
07. Bankrupt - Choose an enemy who will lose all their cash by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
08. Berserker - At 25 HP or less, you deal 50% more damage and move 40% faster.
09. Blackout - Choose the enemy who will receive the blackout effect by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
10. Blademaster - While holding a knife, you have an 85% chance to block a bullet hit.
11. Blast Protection - You are immune to explosive damage.
12. Builder - Activate to place a wooden wall in front of you. Cooldown: 5 seconds.
13. Bunny - Hold jump to automatically jump again when you land.
14. Chameleon - You copy the superpower of the first enemy you kill.
15. Crippler - Hit enemies move 50% slower and deal 30% less damage for 4 seconds.
16. Curser - Choose an enemy who will lose 5 HP for each missed shot by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
17. Damager - Activate to deal 25 damage to all enemies. Cooldown: 30 seconds.
18. Dash - Activate to launch yourself strongly forward. Cooldown: 4 seconds.
19. Deadly Flash - Your flashbangs instantly kill anyone they blind.
20. Death Bomb - On death, you explode, dealing heavy damage to everyone within range.
21. Disarmament - A hit has a 20–40% chance to make the enemy drop their held weapon.
22. Disorient - A hit has a 20–40% chance to turn the enemy 180°.
23. Double Jump - You have an extra jump. Press jump in mid-air to bounce again every 0.5 seconds.
24. Dracula - You restore 50% of the damage you deal, up to 200 HP.
25. Duplicator - Copy the selected enemy’s superpower by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
26. Dwarf - Your player model is scaled down (range: x0.25–x0.75).
27. Ender Grenade - Teleport to the blast area of your HE grenade.
28. Enemy Spawn - Activate to teleport to the enemy spawn. Cooldown: 20 seconds.
29. Entropy - Activate to remove all reserve ammo from the firearm currently held by a random enemy. Cooldown: 20 seconds.
30. Executioner - Any damage you deal to an enemy instantly kills them.
31. Exploding Barrel - Place two explosive barrels where you are aiming. Cooldown: 10 seconds after the second barrel.
32. Explosive Ammo - A bullet impact has a 15–30% chance to trigger an explosion dealing up to 50 damage.
33. Extortion - The selected enemy pays $50 for each shot. Choose an enemy by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
34. Feather Falling - You take no fall damage.
35. Flash-Pro - You are immune to flashbang blindness. Your flashbangs blind enemies for 7 seconds.
36. Freezing Ammo - A hit has a 20–40% chance to freeze the enemy's movement and block their attacks for 3 seconds.
37. Friendly Fire - Shooting teammates heals them for 5% of the damage the shot would have dealt.
38. Gambler - Choose one of three superpowers by typing /1, /2, or /3 in chat.
39. Ghost - You are completely invisible. You can only use a knife and grenades.
40. Giant - Your model is enlarged (range: x1.10–x1.40) and gains bonus HP based on size.
41. God Mode - After activation, you are immune to all damage for 3 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.
42. Grenadier - Your HE grenades never run out.
43. Grounder - Choose an enemy to block jumping until round end by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
44. Hacker - Disable the selected enemy’s radar by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
45. Healing Angel - Regenerate below 125 HP. Restore +50 HP to allies, up to 100 HP. Cooldown: 5 seconds.
46. Healing Smoke - Your smoke heals living teammates by 15 HP per second, up to 100 HP, for 18 seconds.
47. Hook - Activate to fire a rope at the surface you aim at and pull yourself toward it. Cooldown: 5 seconds.
48. Impostor - You change into a random model from the opposing team.
49. Incendiary Ammo - Firearm hits ignite enemies for 3 seconds.
50. Infinite Ammo - Your firearm magazine never runs out of ammunition.
51. Inventor - Activate to place a laser turret that attacks nearby enemies. Tesla: 350 HP / 15–25 DMG. Cooldown: 5 seconds.
52. Juggernaut - Bullets hitting your body deal no damage.
53. Knockback - Firearm shots push you opposite to your aim direction.
54. Knockup - A firearm hit has a 20–40% chance to launch the enemy straight upward.
55. Leech - A hit has a chance to steal the enemy's reserve ammo (range: 20–40%).
56. Lootbox - A killed enemy drops a gift for your team. Aim at it and press “E” to open it.
57. Machete - Knife hits instantly kill living enemies.
58. Medic - You have three medkits per round. Each restores 50 HP, up to 100 HP.
59. Miner - You have five mines per round. They explode when an enemy enters their range. Cooldown: 5 seconds.
60. No Recoil - No camera kick while firing.
61. NoClip - Fly freely, ignoring collisions, for 5 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds after it ends.
62. Phoenix - After death, you have a 50% chance to respawn with your previous equipment.
63. Rambo - You receive bonus health.
64. Random Weapon - Activate to receive a random weapon. Cooldown: 15 seconds.
65. Rapid Fire - Your rate of fire is increased.
66. Regeneration - You regenerate 15 HP every 3 seconds.
67. Replica - Activate to place a replica of your character in front of you. It reflects damage back to the attacker. Cooldown: 25 seconds.
68. Resurrection - You respawn once after your death.
69. Retreat - Activate to teleport back to your team's spawn.
70. Reverser - Activate to reverse a random enemy’s controls for 10 seconds. Cooldown: 15 seconds.
71. Reviver - Every 20 seconds, you can try to revive a random dead teammate (50% chance).
72. Rich Boy - You receive a cash bonus.
73. Robin Hood - Steal $10 from an enemy for every point of damage you deal to them.
74. Sapper - Planting and defusing the bomb take 20–60% less time when your team can perform that objective.
75. Scientist - You can enlarge a selected enemy by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
76. Smoker - Your smoke grenades never run out.
77. Soldier - You deal 15–30% more damage.
78. Speed Demon - Your movement speed is increased.
79. Steel Head - You are immune to headshots.
80. Strip Weapons - Removes all weapons from a random enemy. Cooldown: 30 seconds.
81. Sunshine - Your flashbangs never run out.
82. Swapper - Swap positions with a random living enemy. Cooldown: 30 seconds.
83. Thief - Steal the selected enemy’s superpower by typing /1, /2, etc. in chat.
84. Thorns - Reflect 50% of the actual health damage an enemy deals to you back to that attacker.
85. Toxic Smoke - Your smoke deals 15 damage to enemies every 1 second.
86. Viper - Hits poison enemies: 3 HP every 2.5 s. Further hits add 3 HP poison damage. Poison cannot kill.
87. Wallhack - Enemies are visible through walls when they are close enough.
88. Weapon Swap - Activate to swap the weapon you are currently holding with a random enemy. Cooldown: 20 seconds.
89. Zombie - After death, you respawn as a zombie with 600 HP and x1.50 movement speed. You can only use a knife.
